//! Field offsets of the CPython this crate is compiled against, default (GIL) build. Generated by
//! `build.rs` from `python_offsets.c`:
//!
//! - `THREAD_FRAME`: offset in `PyThreadState` of the current frame, or of `cframe` if
//!   `CFRAME_FRAME` is set.
//! - `CFRAME_FRAME`: offset in `_PyCFrame` of the current frame.
//! - `SKIP_OWNERS`: bit `1 << owner` is set for owners that are not Python frames.
//!
//! Outside 3.11 to 3.14 every offset is 0.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/unwind_layout.rs"));
